      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LENNY'S HONEY (1) has a strong record this track and trip with six wins and two placings from 10 starts. Recorded a 0.8 lengths win (31.01) in a Invitation last time at this track. Looks suited here and rates on top. FANTASTIC SPIKE (2) finished well back at this track last time when a 1.3 lengths fifth (31.09) but scored four back at this track (30.89). Form here at the trip sound including 14 wins. Goes very well from this draw with six wins and four minor placings from 10 starts. Expected to feature in the finish. BLACK CHIP (8) had been racing well prior to his last start fourth at this track following a Invitation win three back with a third placing. Good beginner but will need a little luck early crossing from on outside draw. Expecting sharp improvement this line-up. CARE FACTOR (4) was in the money last time at this track (31.09) in a Invitation, finishing a one length third. Has already won four times from this draw.",
